<metadata><name>Kurobegoro-dake traverse: Yakushi-toge to Shin-Hotaka (days 2-3)</name><desc>Author's GPS track, August 17-18, 2025: Yakushi-toge campsite, Kitanomata-dake, Kurobegoro-dake, cirque, Kurobegoro hut, Mitsumata-renge-dake, Sugoroku-dake, Sugoroku hut, Kagami-daira, Wasabidaira, Shin-Hotaka. Recording gap near Sugoroku hut left as a break. Timestamps removed. en.daringdaddy.com</desc></metadata>
